== phiên bản
nginx version: nginx/1.24.0 (Ubuntu)
== nginx -t
nginx: the configuration file /etc/nginx/nginx.conf syntax is ok
nginx: configuration file /etc/nginx/nginx.conf test is successful
mã 0
== tên chính, tên phụ phục vụ, tên phụ chuyển
N01 tên chính /                  curl=0 200 loc= body=[<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en-US"><head>.<meta charset="U]
N02 tên phụ phục vụ (punycode) / curl=0 200 loc= body=[<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en-US"><head>.<meta charset="U]
N03 tên phụ chuyển /          curl=0 301 loc=http://example.com/ body=[<html>.<head><title>301 Moved Permanently</title></head>.<]
N04 tên phụ chuyển /a?b=1     curl=0 301 loc=http://example.com/a?b=1 body=[<html>.<head><title>301 Moved Permanently</title></head>.<]
N05 tên phụ chuyển: thử thách curl=0 200 loc= body=[t1-acme-ok]
N06 tên chính: thử thách      curl=0 200 loc= body=[t1-acme-ok]
== luật chuyển hướng theo đường dẫn
P01 /old-page                      curl=0 301 loc=http://example.com/new-page body=[<html>.<head><title>301 Moved Permanently</title></head>.<]
P02 /old-page?x=1 (giữ query?)   curl=0 301 loc=http://example.com/new-page body=[<html>.<head><title>301 Moved Permanently</title></head>.<]
P03 /old-page/ (không khớp)     curl=0 404 loc= body=[<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en-US"><head>.<meta charset="U]
P04 /OLD-PAGE (không khớp)      curl=0 404 loc= body=[<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en-US"><head>.<meta charset="U]
P05 //old-page (gộp gạch chéo) curl=0 301 loc=http://example.com/new-page body=[<html>.<head><title>301 Moved Permanently</title></head>.<]
P06 /old%2Dpage (mã hoá %)       curl=0 301 loc=http://example.com/new-page body=[<html>.<head><title>301 Moved Permanently</title></head>.<]
P07 /keepq?a=1&b=2                 curl=0 301 loc=https://example.net/target?a=1&b=2 body=[<html>.<head><title>301 Moved Permanently</title></head>.<]
P08 /keepq (không query)          curl=0 301 loc=https://example.net/target body=[<html>.<head><title>301 Moved Permanently</title></head>.<]
P09 /dropq?a=1                     curl=0 302 loc=https://example.net/target body=[<html>.<head><title>302 Found</title></head>.<body>.<cent]
P10 /old-page qua tên phụ phục vụ curl=0 301 loc=http://xn--vitnam-jk8b.example.net/new-page body=[<html>.<head><title>301 Moved Permanently</title></head>.<]
P11 /old-page qua tên phụ chuyển curl=0 301 loc=http://example.com/old-page body=[<html>.<head><title>301 Moved Permanently</title></head>.<]
== luật chặn có sẵn vẫn đứng
S01 uploads/evil.php (chặn)      curl=0 403 loc= body=[<html>.<head><title>403 Forbidden</title></head>.<body>.<]
S02 uploads/evil2.php (có luật =) curl=0 301 loc=http://example.com/moved body=[<html>.<head><title>301 Moved Permanently</title></head>.<]
S03 /.env (chặn file ẩn)       curl=0 403 loc= body=[<html>.<head><title>403 Forbidden</title></head>.<body>.<]
S04 tên phụ phục vụ: evil.php curl=0 403 loc= body=[<html>.<head><title>403 Forbidden</title></head>.<body>.<]
== bộ định tuyến dựng lại R01-R14 (cho tên phụ)
R01 hoa: WWW.EXAMPLE.COM           curl=0 301 loc=http://example.com/ body=[<html>.<head><title>301 Moved Permanently</title></head>.<]
R02 hoa: XN--VITNAM-JK8B.EXAMPLE.NET curl=0 200 loc= body=[<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en-US"><head>.<meta charset="U]
R03 chấm cuối: www.example.com. curl=0 301 loc=http://example.com/ body=[<html>.<head><title>301 Moved Permanently</title></head>.<]
R04 chấm cuối: punycode.       curl=0 200 loc= body=[<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en-US"><head>.<meta charset="U]
R05 cổng: www.example.com:80     curl=0 301 loc=http://example.com/ body=[<html>.<head><title>301 Moved Permanently</title></head>.<]
R06 cổng lạ: www.example.com:8080 curl=0 301 loc=http://example.com/ body=[<html>.<head><title>301 Moved Permanently</title></head>.<]
R07 Unicode thô trong Host        curl=52 000 loc= body=[]
R08 Host lạ: evil.example.org    curl=52 000 loc= body=[]
R09 Host là IP 127.0.0.1          curl=52 000 loc= body=[]
R10 Host rỗng                    curl=0 400 loc= body=[<html>.<head><title>400 Bad Request</title></head>.<body>.]
R11 Host dài 300 ký tự         curl=52 000 loc= body=[]
R12 tên con chưa khai: x.www.example.com curl=52 000 loc= body=[]
R13 dòng yêu cầu dạng URI tuyệt đối, Host khác curl=52 000 loc= body=[]
R14 URI tuyệt đối trỏ tên phụ, Host lạ curl=0 301 loc=http://example.com/x body=[<html>.<head><title>301 Moved Permanently</title></head>.<]
== $host trong khối chuyển https (đo cho bản SSL)
H01 hostprobe.example.com          curl=0 301 loc=https://hostprobe.example.com/p body=[<html>.<head><title>301 Moved Permanently</title></head>.<]
H02 HOSTPROBE.EXAMPLE.COM.         curl=0 301 loc=https://hostprobe.example.com/p body=[<html>.<head><title>301 Moved Permanently</title></head>.<]
H03 hostprobe.example.com:80       curl=0 301 loc=https://hostprobe.example.com/p body=[<html>.<head><title>301 Moved Permanently</title></head>.<]
H04 URI tuyệt đối khác, Host đúng curl=52 000 loc= body=[]
H05 URI tuyệt đối đúng, Host lạ curl=0 301 loc=https://hostprobe.example.com/p body=[<html>.<head><title>301 Moved Permanently</title></head>.<]
